SUMMARY:Shavuot Community Tikkun  @ Temple Ner Tamid
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Shavuot community celebration with Bnai 
 Keshet\, Shomrei Emunah\, Temple Ner Tamid\, and Temple Sholom of West Ess
 ex. Taking place this year at Temple Ner Tamid\, we will gather together f
 or a night of prayer\, study\, and Torah. In addition to our classes\, tau
 ght by local clergy and congregants\, we will be joined by scholar Moulie 
 Vidas\, Associate Professor of Religion at Princeton University and the au
 thor of numerous works on the Talmud including the National Book award fin
 alist The Rise of Talmud.  \n  \n**Evening Schedule:**  \n7:00pm - Festiva
 l Service  \n7:30pm - Dairy Oneg  \n8:30pm - Keynote Address by Dr. Moulie
  Vidas  \n9:40pm - Breakout Study Sessions 1  \n10:50pm - Breakout Study S
 essions 2   \n12:00am - Study Session with Dr. Moulie Vidas  \n12:45am - R
 eading of the Ten Commandments  \n  \nRegistration_link: https://members.n
 ertamid.org/form/tikkun-leil-shavuot.html\n\n
LOCATION:Temple Ner Tamid\, 936 Broad St\, Bloomfield\, NJ 07003\, USA\, ##
 holiday:shavuot
CATEGORIES:Events
