 ated by Jordana Horn\, Journalist\, Podcaster &amp\; Activist.\n\nDoors Op
 en at 6:15pm  \n$54 - General Admission  \n$250 - Doulbe Mitzvah Shalom Bo
 nd\, VIP Seating &amp\; Cocktail Reception to Follow  \nRegister Here: htt
 ps://www.tbanj.org/rachelgoldberg-polin\n\nOn October 7\, 2023\, Rachel Go
 ldberg-Polin's son\, Hersh\, was taken hostage\, forever changing her life
 . In When We See You Again\, she shares a moving story of grief\, love\, a
 nd the strength to ensure and remember.\n\nCo-Sponsored by Congregation Sh
 omrei Emunah\n\n
